questions.text:
Which elements will have a `color` of `blue` with the following CSS?

```css
p:is(.blue, .highlight) {
  color: blue;
}
```

What does the following CSS rule do?

```css
p:first-of-type {
  font-style: italic;
}
```

What does this CSS selector target?

```css
input:invalid {
  background-color: red;
}
```
